**Bitrise runs the commands that check, build, and deliver your application.** Its YAML configuration names the jobs and defines the steps they execute.

Start with the Bitrise app identified by the successful apply result. If you are setting up CI/CD for the first time, follow [Review & Promote](/mobile/cicd/review-and-promote/) to get there.

<Aside type="caution" title="Do not create bitrise.yml in your application project folder">

